          help = [[Psi4 1.10 - Open-source quantum chemistry package, built from source.
Linked against GCC 12.3.0, OpenBLAS, and MVAPICH2 2.3.7-1.

Basic Usage (single-threaded):
  salloc -N1 -n1 -q<queue> -p<partition> -A<account>
  module purge
  module load gcc/12.3.0
  module load mvapich2/2.3.7-1
  module load psi4/1.10
  mkdir test && cd test
  cp $PSI4_TESTS/tests/dft-b3lyp/input.dat .
  psi4 input.dat

Parallel Usage (multi-threaded, recommended):
  Psi4 parallelism is primarily OpenMP threading within a single node.
  Request multiple CPUs and pass -n to psi4 to use them:

  salloc -N1 -n8 -q<queue> -p<partition> -A<account>
  module purge
  module load gcc/12.3.0
  module load mvapich2/2.3.7-1
  module load psi4/1.10
  mkdir test && cd test
  cp $PSI4_TESTS/tests/dft-b3lyp/input.dat .
  psi4 -n 8 input.dat

Website: https://psicode.org
]],
